  "description": "This is a very well finished two bedroom apartment with a new couch and new oven added into the unit. Well worth a viewing, please email me to arrange a viewing. \n\n20 The Oaks, Rockfield, a contemporary two-bedroom apartment nestled behind electric gates in an exclusive and well-maintained development in the heart of Dundrum. The property is presented in superb condition and tastefully decorated throughout. The accommodation briefly comprises a generous entrance hall with main bathroom and hot-press off, there are two bedrooms (main bedroom with en-suite shower room). The kitchen with balcony off, spacious living/dining area with floor to ceiling windows and door leading to a second balcony. \n\nThe convenience of this location cannot be understated with Dundrum Shopping Centre and Town Centre & LUAS station situated within a 5 minute walk. Sandyford industrial estate, the Beacon complex and Marlay Park are all located close by and are within easy reach. There is a wealth of amenities close by including the Airfield Heritage Urban Farm, health clubs, golf courses, Leopardstown Race Course and the natural beauty of the Dublin Mountains. The M50 is situated within a few minutes M50 drive and provides easy access to all major route-ways and Dublin airport.\n\nProperty comes with one secure parking space.\n\nViewing is highly recommended. *************PLEASE EMAIL YOUR ENQUIRIES**************",
